Subject: [PATCH 4.19 163/191] net: bcmgenet: Remove phy_stop() from bcmgenet_netif_stop()
Date: Mon, 15 May 2023 18:26:40 +0200
Message-Id: <20230515161713.356981889@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.40.1
